    "text": "Execution Rules & Flow:\n1. Parameterized Jump: If %s is used (e.g. .../search?q=%s), query is replaced into URL directly\n2. Target App: If target package is set, forces open with specified App; otherwise uses default App\n3. Auto-fill: If no %s is used and auto-input is ON, fills query into search bar via accessibility after launch",
